  "slug": "whiteboard",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2263_whiteboard.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A teacher walked into the classroom and drew a black dot on the whiteboard. He asked the students, “What is this?” Everyone answered, “A black dot.” The teacher said, “Is that all you see? Didn’t anyone notice this big whiteboard?”",
    "What do you see? Everyone has some shortcomings, but everyone also has many strengths. Try looking from a different angle! You’ll discover many new things."
  ],
  "english_full": "A teacher walked into the classroom and drew a black dot on the whiteboard. He asked the students, “What is this?” Everyone answered, “A black dot.” The teacher said, “Is that all you see? Didn’t anyone notice this big whiteboard?”\n\nWhat do you see? Everyone has some shortcomings, but everyone also has many strengths. Try looking from a different angle! You’ll discover many new things.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Наста́вник вошёл в кла́ссную ко́мнату и нарисо́вал чёрную то́чку на бе́лой доске́. Он спра́шивал студе́нтов: “Что это?” Все отве́тили: “Чёрная то́чка.” Наста́вник ска́зал: “Это всё, что вы ви́дите? Ни́кто не заметил э́ту большо́ю бе́лую доску́?”",
    "Что вы ви́дите? У каждо́го есть не́сколько недоста́тков, но у каждо́го то́же есть мно́го си́л. Попы́тайтесь смотре́ть с друго́го угла́! Вы обнару́жите мно́го но́вых ве́щей."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Nastávnïk voshël v klássnuyu kómmatu i narisováль chërnuyu tóchku na béloy doskě. On spráshival studéntov: “Chto éto?” Vsye otvétili: “Chërnaya tóchka.” Nastávnïk skázal: “Éto vsyo, chto vy vïdíte? Nikkto ne zamétïl étu bol'shóyu béloy doskú?”",
    "Chto vy vïdíte? U každógo yest' néскольko nedostátkov, no u každógo tózhe yest' mnágo síl. Popýtaytes' smotrét' s drugógo uglá! Vy obnarúzhíte mnágo nóvyh véshchey."
  ],
